The .gz siblings in pkg/views/static/ are generated with `gzip -9 -k -n` and are
served by StaticHandler when the client sends Accept-Encoding: gzip. Regenerate
them whenever the corresponding .css changes.

To upgrade:
  1. curl -sSLo pkg/views/static/bulma.min.css \
       https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bulma@<VERSION>/css/bulma.min.css
  2. gzip -9 -k -f -n pkg/views/static/bulma.min.css
  3. Update the version and checksum above.
  4. Review https://github.com/jgthms/bulma/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md
